From c9ba0380b6b207e080922eb9628a232425ff6b1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kazhiramatsu <kazutakehiramatsu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 23:23:30 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] draft: decorator-next witness groups (transform-order,
 super-paths, name-owners)

Diagnostic-free source witnesses generated by
scripts/generate-decorator-next-witness-inputs.py (60 + 42 + 24 commands over
ES2015/ES2022/ESNext x set/define), observed twice with the vendored
TypeScript 6.0.3 by scripts/observe-decorator-next-witnesses.mjs, and compared
as complete commands by the new contracts module
h2_8a_decorator_next_witnesses (TSC_RS_DECORATOR_NEXT_CASE_SET / _FILTER).
No production file changes.
---
